{"v":4,"catch":"一次有趣的鐵路之旅！","desc":"《GUTTANG GOTTONG》是KONAMI於1982年發行的益智遊戲。\n滑動軌道面板來引導您的火車並參觀每個階段的所有車站。\n本作品包含「日本版」和「國際版」。 這些版本的遊戲玩法略有差異 - 嘗試在每個版本中找到不同的獲勝方式！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-10-12","genres":["益智","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a4d277138a4886052e5d73d5f1f9e133c19e1a50cdab8cd4a813dc0bbf22c06e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2cd69c80b490a935e76a7524cc91613377de3222dc60e831428f6554c5adac55.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/492417de069ab74e4eae889c97cb93f0abb556f1817d9c362fbda33f307ca05d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85a12f35751ef37d17512d8b98612426cfc4e9d9ca0e0a2cf3f6526102ef3c65.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/19db6abd93681c24e6432e7117aebdee20f9c84afec4111a60f730e47b5deb25.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/36e93ca8c5b8470edaf2cb943c7aaab388676883200f12aa95affa41b25508f3.jpg"],"titleId":"010032701c054000","dlc":[]}